When built with cgo, this software links to the C libraries below, through the
bindings of go-media (<https://github.com/mutablelogic/go-media>), which is
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. They're linked dynamically when they're
installed with a package manager, such as Homebrew or apt, and statically when
they're built by go-media (GO_MEDIA_PREFIX). A binary built without cgo
(CGO_ENABLED=0) includes none of them.

